\import{fnip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fnip}
\taxon{Example}
\title{Both Hopf points in the Hopf column}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{In the Hopf column of \ref{fnip-0005}, the invariant formula
gives a positive coefficient at both values where the
equilibrium changes stability. Both bifurcations are
subcritical. \citet{p. 57}{ermentrout2010mathematical} places
the fold of periodic orbits at #{88.3}. The model is bistable
for #{88.3<I_{\mathrm{app}}<94} and for
#{212<I_{\mathrm{app}}<217}: a stable equilibrium and a stable
periodic orbit are present together, with the unstable
periodic orbit between them. The frequency of a periodic orbit
born at either Hopf point stays away from zero.}

